  "status": "Historical scanline-tuning measurements. Royale changes were subsequently withdrawn after the player reported visible moire in gameplay. Pattern contrast and still-image checks did not establish acceptable motion quality. Royale now restores automatic interlace detection, former beam widths and former window signal sizing; the samples below do not validate that rollback.",
  "request": "Make the seven CRT models retain visible scanlines/raster at sensible resolutions, preserve dark-scene readability and avoid a large rendering cost.",
